            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_53a54cbd">
               <extent xml:id="extent_33e15d58">30 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_215e5a28">35 x 26</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_f4ebd413">Written in brown ink. Paper: 12 staves. Above the  music "Moderato tranquillamente" has been crossed out in ink and changed to "Poco Andante cantabile". At the bottom of p. 17: "udskrives for sig i et særskilt Hefte som N<rend xml:id="idm27" rend="sup">o</rend> 1 med Stykket i h mol som pag. 6".</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
            <notesStmt xml:id="notesStmt_e2086701">
               <annot type="source_description" xml:id="annot_50e67612">
                  <p xml:id="idm30">On pp. 17-18 in the manuscript of "Studier og Novelletter" (HartW 109). It contains 2 versions of this piece, one of which (on pp. 3-5) has been cancelled in pencil by Hartmann with the following addition in pencil: "Senere omskrevet" (Later rewritten).</p>
               </annot>
            </notesStmt>
